center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p>With these certificates, we’ve got more clout to declare that our products are of high quality! </p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: What is the actual diameter of a 4-inch well pump? Will it fit inside my 4\" diameter well casing?</strong></p><p>A: The diameter of 4SP 4\" submersible well pump is 3.86\" (3-7/8\"). It will fit in a straight 4’’ well properly. </p><p><strong>2. Q: How far down could I put the pump in the well?</strong></p><p>A: The pump needs to be set at a depth that is a minimum of 5’ off the bottom of the well. If your well has a sandy bottom, in order to prevent the pump from picking up sand, it should be set more like 15’ to 20’ off the bottom.</p><p><strong>3. Q: Can you make customized products and customized packing?</strong></p><p>A: OEM and ODM are welcomed. We are focusing on customer service.</p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 4 inch stainless steel impeller pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-screw-pump/3-inch-submersible-screw-pump\"><img alt=\"3 Inch Submersible Screw Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/3-inch-submersible-screw-pump08365148068a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-screw-pump/3-inch-submersible-screw-pump\">3 Inch Submersible Screw Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-submersible-pump/4-inch-diameter-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"4 Inch Diameter Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/4-inch-diameter-submersible-pump48532389820a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-submersible-pump/4-inch-diameter-submersible-pump\">4 Inch Diameter Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><l